            <div class="bg-green-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-green-200">
              <h3
                class="text-lg font-semibold text-green-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"
              >
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                  <path
                    fill-rule="evenodd"
                    d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z"
                    clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                </svg>
                What to DO
              </h3>
              <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700">
                <li>✓ Bring your referral or prescription</li>
                <li>✓ Bring ID and if applicable, insurance cards</li>
                <li>✓ Arrive 15 minutes early</li>
                <li>✓ Take regular medications unless told otherwise</li>
                <li>✓ Inform staff if you're pregnant</li>
                <li>✓ Ask for sedation if anxious (schedule in advance)</li>
                <li>✓ Bring headphones if allowed</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-red-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-red-200">
              <h3
                class="text-lg font-semibold text-red-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"
