                    clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                </svg>
                What NOT to Do
              </h3>
              <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700">
                <li>✗ Don't wear jewelry or watches</li>
                <li>✗ Don't wear clothing with metal zippers/buttons</li>
                <li>✗ Don't bring credit cards or phones into scan room</li>
                <li>✗ Don't wear makeup (some contain metal particles)</li>
                <li>✗ Don't apply lotion or deodorant on scan day</li>
                <li>✗ Don't eat 4-6 hours before (for abdominal scans)</li>
                <li>✗ Don't move during the scan</li>
