                    >
                  </li>
                  <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                    <svg
                      class="w-5 h-5 text-red-600 mt-0.5 shrink-0"
                      fill="currentColor"
                      viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                    >
                      <path
                        fill-rule="evenodd"
                        d="M13.477 14.89A6 6 0 015.11 6.524l8.367 8.368zm1.414-1.414L6.524 5.11a6 6 0 018.367 8.367zM18 10a8 8 0 11-16 0 8 8 0 0116 0z"
                        clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                    </svg>
                    <span
                      ><strong>Cochlear implants</strong> - Can be damaged by the
                      magnetic field</span
                    >
                  </li>
                  <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                    <svg
                      class="w-5 h-5 text-red-600 mt-0.5 shrink-0"
                      fill="currentColor"
                      viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                    >
                      <path
                        fill-rule="evenodd"
                        d="M13.477 14.89A6 6 0 015.11 6.524l8.367 8.368zm1.414-1.414L6.524 5.11a6 6 0 018.367 8.367zM18 10a8 8 0 11-16 0 8 8 0 0116 0z"
                        clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                    </svg>
                    <span
                      ><strong>Metal fragments in eyes</strong> - Can move and cause
                      injury</span
                    >
                  </li>
                  <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                    <svg
                      class="w-5 h-5 text-red-600 mt-0.5 shrink-0"
                      fill="currentColor"
                      viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                    >
                      <path
                        fill-rule="evenodd"
                        d="M13.477 14.89A6 6 0 015.11 6.524l8.367 8.368zm1.414-1.414L6.524 5.11a6 6 0 018.367 8.367zM18 10a8 8 0 11-16 0 8 8 0 0116 0z"
                        clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                    </svg>
                    <span
                      ><strong>Certain aneurysm clips</strong> - Some older clips
                      are not MRI-safe</span
                    >
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3">
                Usually Safe (Inform Your Doctor)
              </h3>
              <div class="bg-yellow-50 rounded-xl p-6 border border-yellow-200">
                <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700">
                  <li>• Joint replacements (hip, knee)</li>
                  <li>• Dental implants and fillings</li>
                  <li>• IUD (intrauterine device)</li>
                  <li>• Surgical clips or staples (after healing)</li>
                  <li>• Most stents</li>
                  <li>• Tattoos (rarely cause warming or irritation)</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
